From 2ecb46ae9cb14ae7f2b67e31e8c22e5a3d94b353 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 12:06:48 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] Admin: open documents from the access log, clearer log UI,
 document transcription in dossier

- Admin endpoints: list child documents, open (5-min link, logged), transcript.
- Transcription on our own server (no external services): pdftotext for PDFs,
  tesseract OCR (rus/kaz/eng) for scans and photos, mammoth/word-extractor for Word.
  Result cached on the document; extraction runs in background after upload.
- Dossier appendices: original + transcription for every document; HEIC photos converted.
- Access log: grouped by day, filters, readable actions, role badges, open document
  or transcript straight from an entry; deleted documents marked.
- API image: poppler-utils, tesseract-ocr (+rus, kaz, eng), libheif-tools.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01B8r16QcS1qxJdA1TRkE5Kw
